, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">原預計擔任<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">COP26</span>大會主席的英國商務部長岑浩文。路透</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">官員今天表示，鑑於新冠肺炎疫情肆虐，原訂<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">11</span>月在蘇格蘭格拉斯哥（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Glasgow</span>）登場的聯合國氣候峰會，已延期至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2021</span>年。這將造成處理全球暖化的對話出現新的不確定性。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">全球平均氣溫目前正面臨災難性地上升，原定為期<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>週的峰會，目的是更新<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2015</span>年各國為了讓全球氣候穩定下來而在巴黎談成協定的國際承諾。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">但目前正值英國主辦方和其他國家遏制<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>冠狀病毒疾病（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">COVID-19</span>，新冠肺炎）疫情之際，而全球經濟也大多陷入停滯。官員決定推延峰會，好讓政府有更多時間準備。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">英國商務部長岑浩文（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Alok Sharma</span>）原預計擔任<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">COP26</span>（氣候變化綱要公約第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">26</span>次締約方會議）的大會主席。他說：「我們將持續不屈不撓地與夥伴一起努力，傳達對抗氣候危機所需的野心，並滿心期待訂下新的大會日期。」</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">聯合國官員表示，另一場原定<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>月在中國雲南省昆明市舉行的有關保護受威脅物種的峰會，也將延至明年舉辦。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">歐盟主管氣候事務首長提孟思（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Frans Timmermans</span>）表示，歐盟仍會遵守巴黎協定的進程，以及去年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>月為了擺脫經濟對化石燃料的依賴推行的「綠色協議」（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Green Deal</span>）。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://udn.com/news/story/6809/4463316</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-04-06","clk_count":"210"}},"__N_SSG":true}